0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"study":{"id":"arjun","title":"Who can certify the record?","category":"Landmark judgment","year":"2020","subtitle":"Arjun Panditrao Khotkar v. Kailash Kushanrao Gorantyal","fictional":false,"difficulty":"Electronic evidence","summary":"A Constitution Bench clarified section 65B certification and the distinction between producing an original device and proving electronic output.","story":["The dispute concerned electronic material and the steps needed to rely on it. The Court reviewed the earlier authorities, including Anvar and Shafhi Mohammad, to resolve uncertainty about certification.","The decision clarified the certificate requirement for the output route and disapproved the relaxation in Shafhi. It also explained the different position where the original device itself is produced, and discussed steps a party may take to obtain a necessary certificate from a source it does not control.","For present practice, the key is not to replace every occurrence of “65B” with “63”. The BSA has a prescribed Schedule, party and expert portions, and express hash particulars. The underlying questions of source, control, process, and truthful certification remain essential."],"timeline":[{"date":"2014","event":"Anvar states the special electronic-proof approach."},{"date":"2018","event":"Shafhi creates uncertainty through a relaxation."},{"date":"2020","event":"The Constitution Bench clarifies the position."},{"date":"2024","event":"The BSA introduces the current scheduled certificate."}],"issue":"When a certificate is required and how the electronic-evidence proof framework should be applied.","holding":"Arjun clarified the former section 65B position, including the original-device distinction and disapproval of Shafhi’s relaxation. Read it with the current BSA text.","lessons":["Do not treat screenshots as automatically admissible or inadmissible.","Identify the form of evidence actually submitted.","Use lawful steps to obtain third-party certification.","Record the source and production process.","Do not reuse the old one-signature form unchanged."],"questions":["How does control of the source affect preparation?","Why is the output-versus-original distinction important?","What should a current Part A and Part B worksheet contain?"],"sources":["arjun","bsa","bsa-schedule"],"topics":["2.9","2.10","4.12"]}}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/07qngb6s2_y2q.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"mMiCr23A_-Cpk0hZkfT7X"}
